Dear students,

The Career Development Cell is hosting a resume building workshop for
pre-final-year students ahead of the placement season.

  Date: Friday, 13 November 2026
  Time: 14:00-16:00 IST
  Venue: Seminar Hall B, Academic Block
  Seats: 60, allotted in order of confirmation

What we will cover:
- Structuring a clear one-page resume
- Writing project and internship points that show impact
- Common mistakes seen in last year's applications
- Short one-to-one reviews at the end (sign up on the day)

Please reply to this email by Wednesday, 11 November 2026 to confirm
your seat, and accept the attached calendar invitation.

Regards,
Career Development Cell
Northfield Institute of Technology
--=_TW_ALT_bee869cc86c4d08f
